              <div style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);letter-spacing:-0.01em;margin-bottom:9px;text-wrap:balance;">Wafer level packaging (WLCSP)</div>
              <p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;margin:0 0 18px;">Chip-scale packaging completed at wafer level for applications where footprint and profile need to remain close to the die itself.</p>
              <span class="hub-card-go" style="margin-top:auto;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--hana-blue);">View capability <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span>
            </div></a><a href="/capabilities/osat/flip-chip" class="hub-card" style="border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;"><div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-top-left-radius:var(--radius-card);border-top-right-radius:var(--radius-card);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);width:100%;aspect-ratio:16 / 9;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,transparent 0 13px,rgba(18,131,221,0.06) 13px 14px);"><div style="position:absolute;top:10px;left:12px;width:16px;height:16px;opacity:.4;"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4"></path></svg></div><span style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);text-align:center;padding:0 14px;line-height:1.5;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.04em;">[ Flip chip & interconnect ]</span></div><div style="padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;flex:1;">
